{"ID":"20250328162002-5hid52x","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250328162002-5hid52x","title":"CPPS1L1——第一个应用程序","type":"doc","updated":"20250328170944"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328170159-3ek4fkl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328170159-3ek4fkl","updated":"20250328170554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250328170213-06kjp7x","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328170213-06kjp7x","updated":"20250328170554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 单行注释，主要用来注释一行内容\n/* 多行注释 \n * 可以注释多行内容\n */\nstd::cout           // 对 std::cout 使用 \u003c\u003c 即可输出信息\nstd::cin            // 对 std::cin 使用 \u003e\u003e 即可让控制台等待用户输入一段字符串到一个变量内\nstd::endl           // 相对于换行，对 std::cout 使用 \u003c\u003c std::endl 即可让控制台换行\nusing namespace     // 引用命名空间\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328162002-mot8eyo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162002-mot8eyo","updated":"20250328162421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注释"}]},{"ID":"20250328162019-8b83n3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328162019-8b83n3b","updated":"20250328162037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注释就是对代码的解释和说明，其目的是让人们能够更加轻松地了解代码。\n注释内容不会被程序识别，只起到说明作用。"}]},{"ID":"20250328162039-nkxs04p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162039-nkxs04p","updated":"20250328162421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注释的两种方式"}]},{"ID":"20250328162055-ct1gy0a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250328162055-ct1gy0a","updated":"20250328162420"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328162342-7ry6jg3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328162342-7ry6jg3","updated":"20250328162412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328162342-25g494g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328162342-25g494g","updated":"20250328162347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单行注释"}]},{"ID":"20250328162348-o0bbl3d","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162348-o0bbl3d","updated":"20250328162412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"std::cout \u003c\u003c \"Hello World!\\n\";  // 单行注释，主要用来注释一行内容\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328162355-ylf0un5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328162355-ylf0un5","updated":"20250328162420"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328162355-tt4bdhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328162355-tt4bdhb","updated":"20250328162358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多行注释"}]},{"ID":"20250328162358-cl8j8rs","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162358-cl8j8rs","updated":"20250328162420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 多行注释 \n * 可以注释多行内容\n */\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250328162421-nf68msd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162421-nf68msd","updated":"20250328164025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++程序文件基础结构及固定写法"}]},{"ID":"20250328162455-3jwxjd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328162455-3jwxjd9","updated":"20250328163241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++ 中几乎所有的程序逻辑写在语句块中，被大括号包裹的部分就是语句块，\n语句块有多种，如函数语句块、类语句块等等，不同语句块的代码规则不一样，\n也有可以不写在语句块中的代码（比如类型定义、函数定义、类定义等等）"}]},{"ID":"20250328162811-mp500cz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162811-mp500cz","updated":"20250328162843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int main()\n{\n    // 这里就是一个语句块\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328164005-t0czn5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328164005-t0czn5k","updated":"20250328164006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完成一行命令书写后，以 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":";"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 结束（注意是英文的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":";"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ ！）"}]},{"ID":"20250328164007-1thq6ut","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328164007-1thq6ut","updated":"20250328164025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"std::cout \u003c\u003c \"Hello world!\\n\";\t// 每写完一行代码，就需要使用;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328163219-1ss0s5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328163219-1ss0s5b","updated":"20250328163259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一个最简单的 C++ 程序结构，其具体部分可以拆解为："}]},{"ID":"20250328163215-vhdyo0l","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328163215-vhdyo0l","updated":"20250328163836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 预处理指令 #include（包含、包括的意思）表示引用（使用）别人或者系统写好的代码的\n// 用\u003c\u003e包裹起来的一般是系统提供的写好的代码 编译器会在专门的系统路径中去进行查找\n// 以后我们自己写的代码文件 一般都通过\"\"包裹起来 编译器会在当前文件所在的目录中查找，找不到才会去系统路径重查找\n#include \u003ciostream\u003e\t\t// 预处理指令 #include（包含、包括的意思）\n\nint main()\t\t\t\t// 函数声明，main是程序启动后默认的执行入口\n{\n    //程序语句——在控制台打印出Hello World\n    // std::               —— 命名空间 类似文件夹 管理着不同的\"文章\" 避免不同文章之间出现重名等等问题\n    // cout \u003c\u003c             —— 命令一个命名空间中的对象去执行一个行为（在这这个行为就是在控制台去打印信息）\n    // \"Hello World!\\n\"    —— 我们传递给这个行为的一些数据 （字符串数据）\\n代表要换行\n    // ;                   —— 代码结束\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c \"Hello world!\\n\";\n    // 简单来说，要输出一句字符串，就需要写 std::cout \u003c\u003c\n\n    return 0;           // 这句代码是可以省略的 因为C++当中对于main函数会进行特殊的处理，如果不写返回0，编译器也会自动的返回0\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328162918-jtpvaen","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328162918-jtpvaen","updated":"20250328164554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"控制台输入输出语句"}]},{"ID":"20250328163925-mykjgxf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"alias":"std::endl","id":"20250328163925-mykjgxf","name":"std::cout","updated":"20250328164554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出到控制台"}]},{"ID":"20250328164108-ofb2m4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328164108-ofb2m4f","updated":"20250328164405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::cout"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\u0026lt;\u0026lt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 即可输出信息，如果要换行，除了输出 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 以外，还可以输出 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::endl"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，如果需要多次输出信息，可以连续使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\u0026lt;\u0026lt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250328164307-g0nrt8k","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328164307-g0nrt8k","updated":"20250328164537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003ciostream\u003e\n\nint main()\n{\n\tstd::cout \u003c\u003c \"Hello, world!\\n\";\n\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c \"唐老狮\\n\";\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c \"唐老狮\";\n\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c \"唐老狮222\" \u003c\u003c std::endl \u003c\u003c \"哈哈哈哈\";\n    // 上面的一行代码等效于下面的三行代码\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c \"唐老狮222\";\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c \"哈哈哈哈\\n\";\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328164537-2zrn5vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328164537-2zrn5vb","updated":"20250328164538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250328164541-togxfg1","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328164541-togxfg1","updated":"20250328164552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Hello, world!\n唐老狮\n唐老狮唐老狮222\n哈哈哈哈唐老狮222\n哈哈哈哈\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328164554-jgjmr6f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328164554-jgjmr6f","name":"std::cin","updated":"20250328165158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从控制台输入"}]},{"ID":"20250328164635-it8lngw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328164635-it8lngw","updated":"20250328165146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::cin"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\u0026gt;\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 即可让控制台等待用户输入一段字符串（用户输入一段信息后按下Enter，也就是输入换行时代表输入信息的结束）到一个变量内"}]},{"ID":"20250328164731-ujvhhth","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328164731-ujvhhth","updated":"20250328164948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003ciostream\u003e\n\nint main()\n{\n\tstd::string input;\n\tstd::cin \u003e\u003e input;\n\tstd::cout \u003c\u003c \"用户输入了：\" \u003c\u003c input \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328164949-h184y2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328164949-h184y2g","updated":"20250328165106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出（输入 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"aaaa"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 后按 Enter）："}]},{"ID":"20250328164953-3tdg1g0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328164953-3tdg1g0","updated":"20250328165044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"请输入信息：aaaa\n用户输入了：aaaa\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328165156-8pq32vp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328165156-8pq32vp","name":"using namespace","updated":"20250328170627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"引用命名空间"}]},{"ID":"20250328165204-tha0yvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328165204-tha0yvv","updated":"20250328165525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cout"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cin"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 都属于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 命名空间，因此在不引用命名空间的情况下调用他们都需要使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 来代表引用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 命名空间的内容\n如果要避免每次都写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，可以使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"using namespace"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 来引用命名空间，它会直接引用命名空间内所有的内容，这样就不用写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"命名空间::"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 了"}]},{"ID":"20250328165520-ntlnvia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328165520-ntlnvia","updated":"20250328165934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"using namespace"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 可以在语句块内写，也可以在语句块外写，\n在语句块内写，则该语句块内所有语句都可以不写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"命名空间::"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，但其他语句块还是要写"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"命名空间::"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n"}]},{"ID":"20250328165824-hg92swf","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328165824-hg92swf","updated":"20250328170108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003ciostream\u003e\n\nint main()\n{\n\tusing namespace std;\n    // 此语句块内引用了std，后续不需要再写std::\n\tstring input;\n\tcout \u003c\u003c \"请输入信息：\";\n\tcin \u003e\u003e input;\n\tcout \u003c\u003c \"用户输入了：\" \u003c\u003c input \u003c\u003c endl;\n}\n\nint otherblock()\n{\n    // 此语句块内没有引用了std，需要写std::\n\tstd::string input;\n\tstd::cout \u003c\u003c \"请输入信息：\";\n\tstd::cin \u003e\u003e input;\n\tstd::cout \u003c\u003c \"用户输入了：\" \u003c\u003c input \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328165455-vd2lf2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328165455-vd2lf2c","updated":"20250328165735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在语句块内写，"}]},{"ID":"20250328165935-87ozymu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328165935-87ozymu","updated":"20250328165935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-family: var(--b3-font-family-protyle); font-size: var(--b3-font-size-editor); background-color: var(--b3-theme-background); color: var(--b3-theme-on-background);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在语句块外写，则所有的语句块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-family: var(--b3-font-family-protyle); font-size: var(--b3-font-size-editor); background-color: var(--b3-theme-background); color: var(--b3-theme-on-background);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内所有语句都可以不写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"命名空间::"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250328165936-00e0lf3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328165936-00e0lf3","updated":"20250328170128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003ciostream\u003e\n\nusing namespace std;\n// 引用了std，下方所有的语句块内后续不需要再写std::\n\nint main()\n{\n\tstring input;\n\tcout \u003c\u003c \"请输入信息：\";\n\tcin \u003e\u003e input;\n\tcout \u003c\u003c \"用户输入了：\" \u003c\u003c input \u003c\u003c endl;\n}\n\nint otherblock()\n{\n\tstring input;\n\tcout \u003c\u003c \"请输入信息：\";\n\tcin \u003e\u003e input;\n\tcout \u003c\u003c \"用户输入了：\" \u003c\u003c input \u003c\u003c endl;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328170626-59xyyol","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328170626-59xyyol","updated":"20250328170944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"折叠代码"}]},{"ID":"20250328170639-e5j6ipb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328170639-e5j6ipb","updated":"20250328170733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要作用是让我们编程时逻辑更加清晰，它是由："}]},{"ID":"20250328170735-550edzz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328170735-550edzz","updated":"20250328170741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#pragma region 折叠内容描述\n#pragma endregion\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328170734-utwf4n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328170734-utwf4n7","updated":"20250328170816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"#pragma region"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"#pragma endregion"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是配对出现的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"region"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是区域的意思 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pragma"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是编译指令的意思）\n它的具体作用 是可以将中间包裹的代码折叠起来 避免代码太凌乱\n本质是 编辑器提供给我们的 预处理指令，它只会在编辑时有用 发布了代码 或执行代码 它会被自动删除"}]},{"ID":"20250328170925-f6qminr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328170925-f6qminr","updated":"20250328170925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250328170925-dio5jzn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250328170926-eb7rqpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328170926-eb7rqpe","updated":"20250328170943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"效果如下："}]},{"ID":"20250328170944-yg7lslj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328170944-yg7lslj","updated":"20250328170944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250328170944-geu9boi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}